thout_material_still_round_trip` synthetic tracker from repo-root `.rebar-test-sidecar-material` to pytest `tmp_path`. Targeted sidecar test passed, 29a6 core autodeploy tests passed, and `make lint` passed. Amending Gerrit change 2480 next; final AC waits for Verified rerun.","timestamp":1788298312763495001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Patch set 2 containing this tmp_path isolation fix has GitHub Verified workflow success (`33562114198`) but final Gerrit read/submit is blocked because Gerrit HTTPS/SSH are timing out from the host. Leaving ticket in_progress until Gerrit is reachable and change 2480 can be submitted/closed normally.","timestamp":1788302923971812001}],"created_at":1788297893668306001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"655e92cd-9f37-4d9e-95fe-5cbb01f10aa6","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"29a6-bbb7-0114-400a"},{"link_uuid":"c3a61fac-247f-41bd-a35a-90439b2db483","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"ea5a-654a-d057-4e37"}],"description":"## Summary\nCI for Gerrit change 2480 exposed a py3.11 xdist leak: `tests/unit/test_completion_sidecar_material_balding.py::test_legacy_payloads_without_material_still_round_trip` created `.rebar-test-sidecar-material` under `Path.cwd()` / repo root. During xdist, another test could snapshot repo root while that directory existed and fail in `tests/conftest.py::_no_repo_root_leaks`.\n\n## Root cause\nThe test fixture used a repo-root scratch directory for its synthetic tracker. That directory was briefly visible to unrelated tests. The fix uses pytest `tmp_path`, which is per-test disposable storage outside the checkout.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] `test_legacy_payloads_without_material_still_round_trip` writes its synthetic tracker under `tmp_path`, not `Path.cwd()` / repo root.\n- [x] The targeted sidecar-material test passes.\n- [ ] The 29a6 Gerrit change 2480 Verified gate no longer fails on `.rebar-test-sidecar-material` repo-root leakage.\n\n## Testing\n- `python -m pytest tests/unit/test_completion_sidecar_material_balding.py::test_legacy_payloads_without_material_still_round_trip -q` — passed.\n- `python -m pytest tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py::test_port_exhausted_routine_backoff_does_not_inflate_deploy_errors tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py::test_low_memory_routine_backoff_does_not_inflate_deploy_errors tests/scripts/test_autodeploy_mcp_bluegreen.py::test_mcp_failure_keeps_the_deploy_failed_metric_and_names_the_component -q` — passed.\n- `make lint` — passed.\n- Gerrit change 2480 Verified rerun pending.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/test_completion_sidecar_material_balding.py","reason":"Move the legacy payload round-trip test synthetic tracker from Path.cwd()/.rebar-test-sidecar-material to pytest tmp_path so xdist never exposes a repo-root leak to unrelated tests."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","ea5a-654a-d057-4e37"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"10c87ea2-35b6-4f82-ab4f-770c04a957a7","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"ddc2-66ae-a863-4e09","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Completion sidecar material test leaks repo-root scratch dir under xdist","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["90447ece-24a0-4458-9c69-7d3c02ae791b","b41124b2-68bf-44b1-8628-392207dcc8c3","655e92cd-9f37-4d9e-95fe-5cbb01f10aa6","d8f1e5e7-94f0-44ee-a403-5916a5423d4b","10c87ea2-35b6-4f82-ab4f-770c04a957a7","cb7f2349-05d5-461e-8ff2-3e4fac3fc393","69abe087-6a47-419d-a956-cf623c2625ab","dca15a16-953a-4fa6-af4d-7b828f1acef3","6007d660-3e5f-4c4e-bfd7-54d0e9ca3137","c3a61fac-247f-41bd-a35a-90439b2db483"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126",